  "tags": "资源管理",
  "productshort": "ManageOneOCHCS",
  "region_id": "cn-north-4",
  "paths": {
    "/rest/cmdb/v1/classes/{className}/attrs/{attrName}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "查询指定资源类型的单个属性",
        "description": "查询指定资源类型的单个属性\n\n**接口SLA:**\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| ≥ 99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|10 tps|\n|TP50请求时延|1000 ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|2000 ms|",
        "x-precautions": "使用前请参考《资源北向模型》,获取系统支持的资源类型、关系类型、资源分类及属性列表。调用该接口需要“查询模型”权限,归属权限组:运维中心>模型管理。\n错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运维面API参考 > 错误码说明 > 资源管理特性”章节。\n",
        "tags": [
          "资源管理"
        ],
        "operationId": "ShowAttribute",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "IAM_OP token、SSO token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "className",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "path",
            "maxLength": 60,
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "资源类型标识。",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "name": "attrName",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "path",
            "maxLength": 60,
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "资源属性名称。",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询资源类型的单个属性成功。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CIAttributeDef"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "name": "name",
                "writeable": true,
                "unique": false,
